title: CallCatDay2
position: 422,282
---
<<hide_all_objects>>
<<hide_all_ui_objects>>
<<show PCRoom>>
<<hide MonitorOn>>
<<show MonitorSilhouette>>
<<show_character Cat Obscure right>>
